{"schemaVersion":1,"type":"selected","window":"24h","checkedAt":"2026-11-24T10:48:23.709Z","items":[{"id":"https://aihot.news/items/jb7ohptrc5ctyx9maoimz2hn0","title":"卡兹克分享两个优化用户体验和产品动效的 Prompt","topic":"开发","publishedAt":"2026-11-24T06:12:14.000Z","urls":["https://aihot.news/items/jb7ohptrc5ctyx9maoimz2hn0","https://x.com/Khazix0918/status/2125110224143171669"],"articles":[{"id":"jb7ohptrc5ctyx9maoimz2hn0","title":"卡兹克分享两个优化用户体验和产品动效的 Prompt","originalTitle":"分享两个最近我自己做产品用来优化用户体验和产品动效的Prompt，我觉得效果还挺不错的。","summary":"数字生命卡兹克分享自己做产品时用的两个 Prompt，一个按用户体验至上的原则审查项目交互并直接修复，一个把项目动效做到细腻丝滑水准。要点包括让 Gemini 当方案顾问、按状态变化逐项审查动效，完成后让 GPT 审查再合并上线。","reason":"作者把自己做产品时审查用户体验和动效的完整 Prompt 原则直接公开，按状态变化找动效等思路可直接迁移到其他项目。","url":"https://aihot.news/items/jb7ohptrc5ctyx9maoimz2hn0","originalUrl":"https://x.com/Khazix0918/status/2125110224143171669","publishedAt":"2026-11-24T06:12:14.000Z","sourcePublishedAt":"2026-11-24T06:12:14.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-24T06:12:23.354Z","datePrecision":"source","sourceId":"aihot-1vqp2uz","originalSourceName":"X：卡兹克 (@Khazix0918)","family":"outlet-xxwkks","kind":"community","provider":"aihot","category":"tip","sectionLabel":"","selected":true,"contentMode":"licensed-summary","contentType":"news","translationStatus":"original","evidenceRole":"discovery","rights":{"licenseId":"LicenseRef-AIHOT-Written-Permission","permissionId":"aihot-mojing-written-2026-11-04","provider":"aihot","scope":"text-summary","evidenceUrl":"https://aihot.news/items/jb7ohptrc5ctyx9maoimz2hn0","licenseUrl":"https://aihot.news/terms","checkedAt":"2026-11-24T10:48:23.709Z","attribution":"导读来源：AIHOT；原报道权利归原作者","modified":"保留 AIHOT 原摘要，未二次改写"}}],"familyCount":0,"mergeReasons":[],"selectionReasons":["作者把自己做产品时审查用户体验和动效的完整 Prompt 原则直接公开，按状态变化找动效等思路可直接迁移到其他项目。"],"provider":"aihot","sourceStates":[{"id":"aihot-1vqp2uz","name":"X：卡兹克 (@Khazix0918)","status":"ok","lastSuccessAt":"2026-11-24T10:48:23.709Z"}]},{"id":"https://aihot.news/items/f1380j6hyrxn0rnz6666nu3b8","title":"MiniMax 发布 H3