media/p/jensen-returns"],"articles":[{"id":"zto0pspydy8330r0bvwqb6j5z","title":"ChinaTalk 播客：Nvidia 董事会恢复黄仁勋职务，美商务部将 Megaspeed 列入实体清单","originalTitle":"","summary":"ChinaTalk 主持人 Jordan Schneider 邀请 Chris McGuire 与 Peter Harrell 紧急讨论 Nvidia 董事会在美国政府表态后一致恢复黄仁勋职务，以及美国商务部同日将 Megaspeed 列入实体清单。节目围绕出口管制执法、实体清单是否附加外国直接产品规则（FDPR）、国会相关立法（AI Overwatch、MATCH、RASA）的覆盖范围与局限，以及政策与股市波动之间的互动展开分析。","reason":"嘉宾来自美国外交关系委员会与乔治城大学，逐层拆解董事会复职决定背后的法律承诺、FDPR 缺失和监管漏洞，提供了不少可核验的政策细节。","url":"https://aihot.news/items/zto0pspydy8330r0bvwqb6j5z","originalUrl":"https://www.chinatalk.media/p/jensen-returns","publishedAt":"2026-11-24T01:41:25.000Z","sourcePublishedAt":"2026-11-24T01:41:25.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-24T01:48:25.505Z","datePrecision":"source","sourceId":"aihot-1u6m59j","originalSourceName":"ChinaTalk（RSS）","family":"outlet-1z0ikz9","kind":"media","provider":"aihot","category":"industry","sectionLabel":"","selected":true,"contentMode":"licensed-summary","contentType":"news","translationStatus":"original","evidenceRole":"discovery","rights":{"licenseId":"LicenseRef-AIHOT-Written-Permission","permissionId":"aihot-mojing-written-2026-11-04","provider":"aihot","scope":"text-summary","evidenceUrl":"https://aihot.news/items/zto0pspydy8330r0bvwqb6j5z","licenseUrl":"https://aihot.news/terms","checkedAt":"2026-11-24T10:48:23.709Z","attribution":"导读来源：AIHOT；原报道权利归原作者","modified":"保留 AIHOT 原摘要，未二次改写"}}],"familyCount":0,"mergeReasons":[],"selectionReasons":["嘉宾来自美国外交关系委员会与乔治城大学，逐层拆解董事会复职决定背后的法律承诺、FDPR 缺失和监管漏洞，提供了不少可核验的政策细节。"],"provider":"aihot","sourceStates":[{"id":"aihot-1u6m59j","name":"ChinaTalk（RSS）","status":"ok","lastSuccessAt":"2026-11-24T10:48:23.709Z"}]},{"id":"https://aihot.news/items/d41p6k2h48zm8u2kl5xdzqx5h","title":"OpenAI 与 Cisco 发布开源 Linux 运行时 Shirudo，让 Agent 无停机防御系统","topic":"应用","publishedAt":"2026-11-24T08:15:44.000Z","urls":["https://aihot.news/items/d41p6k2h48zm8u2kl5xdzqx5h","https://x.com/thsottiaux/status/2125141302501417232"],"articles":[{"id":"d41p6k2h48zm8u2kl5xdzqx5h","title":"OpenAI 与 Cisco 发布开源 Linux 运行时 Shirudo，让 Agent 无停机防御系统","originalTitle":"We’re working with Cisco on what we think are going to be key infrastructure primitives in the new era of cybersecurity.","summary":"OpenAI 宣布与 Cisco 合作推出开源 Linux 运行时 Shirudo，让 Agent 编写动态 eBPF 控制来抵御漏洞利用，同时保持服务不中断，为防御方争取测试和部署补丁的时间。作者称这是迈向自适应自防御基础设施的第一步，目标是让防御者与 AI Agent 协作定位受影响系统、测试并共享 shield、在不干扰工作负载的情况下部署。","reason":"原文点出 Cisco 与 OpenAI 合作构建面向 Agent 时代的安全基础设施，可帮助读者了解防御方与 AI 协作的新方向。","url":"https://aihot.news/items/d41p6k2h48zm8u2kl5xdzqx5h","originalUrl":"https://x.com/thsottiaux/status/2125141302501417232","publishedAt":"2026-11-24T08:15:44.000Z","sourcePublishedAt":"2026-11-24T08:15:44.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-24T09:23:31.975Z","datePrecision":"source","sourceId":"aihot-nrh88s","originalSourceName":"X：Tibo (@thsottiaux)","family":"outlet-1rouqv3","kind":"community","provider":"aihot","category":"ai-products","sectionLabel":"","selected":true,"contentMode":"licensed-summary","contentType":"news","translationStatus":"original","evidenceRole":"discovery","rights":{"licenseId":"LicenseRef-AIHOT-Written-Permission","permissionId":"aihot-mojing-written-2026-11-04","provider":"aihot","scope":"text-summary","evidenceUrl":"https://aihot.news/items/d41p6k2h48zm8u2kl5xdzqx5h","licenseUrl":"https://aihot.news/terms","checkedAt":"2026-11-24T10:48:23.709Z","attribution":"导读来源：AIHOT；原报道权利归原作者","modified":"保留 AIHOT 原摘要，未二次改写"}}],"familyCount":0,"mergeReasons":[],"selectionReasons":["原文点出 Cisco 与 OpenAI 合作构建面向 Agent 时代的安全基础设施，可帮助读者了解防御方与 AI 协作的新方向。"],"provider":"aihot","sourceStates":[{"id":"aihot-nrh88s","name":"X：Tibo (@thsottiaux)","status":"ok","lastSuccessAt":"2026-11-24T10:48:23.709Z"}]},{"id":"https://aihot.news/items/h1vnjuwxsli7ku7rpocjlr3s2","title":"Claude 推出插件，统一连接器与技能的接入方式","topic":"应用","publishedAt":"2026-11-23T20:56:12.000Z","urls":["https://aihot.news/items/h1vnjuwxsli7ku7rpocjlr3s2","https://x.com/claudeai/status/2124970294523945328"],"articles":[{"id":"h1vnjuwxsli7ku7rpocjlr3s2","title":"Claude 推出插件，统一连接器与技能的接入方式","originalTitle":"There’s now one way to connect your tools to Claude, teach it a new skill, or do both.","summary":"Claude 官方宣布将连接器和技能合并为插件，提供统一的方式为 Claude 接入工具或教授新技能。插件已在 Free、Pro、Max 和 Ultra 套餐上线，Team 和 Enterprise 即将支持，用户可在 https://claude.ai/plugins 浏览 10,000 多个插件。","reason":"官方宣布连接器与技能合并为插件，读者可据此了解 Claude 工具接入方式的统一变化和覆盖套餐。","url":"https://aihot.news/items/h1vnjuwxsli7ku7rpocjlr3s2","originalUrl":"https://x.com/claudeai/status/2124970294523945328","publishedAt":"2026-11-23T20:56:12.000Z","sourcePublishedAt":"2026-11-23T20:56:12.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-23T21:17:20.763Z","datePrecision":"source","sourceId":"aihot-v1d3el","originalSourceName":"X：Claude (@claudeai)","family":"anthropic","kind":"community","provider":"aihot","category":"ai-products","sectionLabel":"","selected":true,"contentMode":"licensed-summary","contentType":"news","translationStatus":"original","evidenceRole":"discovery","rights":{"licenseId":"LicenseRef-AIHOT-Written-Permission","permissionId":"aihot-mojing-written-2026-11-04","provider":"aihot","scope":"text-summary","evidenceUrl":"https://aihot.news/items/h1vnjuwxsli7ku7rpocjlr3s2","licenseUrl":"https://aihot.news/terms","checkedAt":"2026-11-24T10:48:23.709Z","attribution":"导读来源：AIHOT；原报道权利归原作者","modified":"保留 AIHOT 原摘要，未二次改写"}}],"familyCount":0,"mergeReasons":[],"selectionReasons":["官方宣布连接器与技能合并为插件，读者可据此了解 Claude 工具接入方式的统一变化和覆盖套餐。"],"provider":"aihot","sourceStates":[{"id":"aihot-v1d3el","name":"X：Claude (@claudeai)","status":"ok","lastSuccessAt":"2026-11-24T10:48:23.709Z"}]},{"id":"https://aihot.news/items/gj8mzwrgqlkvim6xe382a35q2","title":"Anthropic 访谈 58 家企业客户：AI 采用的价值、雇佣影响与组织重组","topic":"研究","publishedAt":"2026-11-22T16:00:00.000Z","urls":["https://aihot.news/items/gj8mzwrgqlkvim6xe382a35q2","https://www.anthropic.com/research/working-with-ai"],"articles":[{"id":"gj8mzwrgqlkvim6xe382a35q2","title":"Anthropic 访谈 58 家企业客户：AI 采用的价值、雇佣影响与组织重组","originalTitle":"Working with AI","summary":"Anthropic 研究团队对 58 家企业客户进行 66 次面对面访谈，分析企业采用 AI 的方式、瓶颈与组织变化。研究发现多数 AI 应用通过扩大产出而非削减成本创造价值；直接裁员案例很少，但约三分之二的公司因 AI 减少招聘，九家削减外包和离岸承包商；高价值应用通常需要更深度的组织重组，如拓宽岗位职责、把员工转向 AI 无法完成的瓶颈任务，以及为非技术员工建设数据和基础设施支持。","reason":"Anthropic 基于 58 家企业客户的 66 次访谈，梳理 AI 采用中的价值来源、雇佣影响和组织瓶颈，并给出围绕瓶颈重设岗位的可迁移做法。","url":"https://aihot.news/items/gj8mzwrgqlkvim6xe382a35q2","originalUrl":"https://www.anthropic.com/research/working-with-ai","publishedAt":"2026-11-22T16:00:00.000Z","sourcePublishedAt":"2026-11-22T16:00:00.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-23T21:12:17.546Z","datePrecision":"source","sourceId":"aihot-14mqazp","originalSourceName":"Anthropic：Research（发表成果 · 网页）","family":"anthropic","kind":"official","provider":"aihot","category":"paper","sectionLabel":"","selected":true,"contentMode":"licensed-summary","contentType":"news","translationStatus":"original","evidenceRole":"discovery","rights":{"licenseId":"LicenseRef-AIHOT-Written-Permission","permissionId":"aihot-mojing-written-2026-11-04","provider":"aihot","scope":"text-summary","evidenceUrl":"https://aihot.news/items/gj8mzwrgqlkvim6xe382a35q2","licenseUrl":"https://aihot.news/terms","checkedAt":"2026-11-24T10:48:23.709Z","attribution":"导读来源：AIHOT；原报道权利归原作者","modified":"保留 AIHOT 原摘要，未二次改写"}}],"familyCount":0,"mergeReasons":[],"selectionReasons":["Anthropic 基于 58 家企业客户的 66 次访谈，梳理 AI 采用中的价值来源、雇佣影响和组织瓶颈，并给出围绕瓶颈重设岗位的可迁移做法。"],"provider":"aihot","sourceStates":[{"id":"aihot-14mqazp","name":"Anthropic：Research（发表成果 · 网页）","status":"ok","lastSuccessAt":"2026-11-24T10:48:23.709Z"}]},{"id":"https://aihot.news/items/zur9ndkrkvtk4lqiix14q468s","title":"Figma agent 正式开放至 FigJam 和 Figma Slides","topic":"应用","publishedAt":"2026-11-23T20:54:00.000Z","urls":["https://aihot.news/items/zur9ndkrkvtk4lqiix14q468s","https://www.figma.com/blog/introducing-figma-agent-in-figjam-and-slides"],"articles":[{"id":"zur9ndkrkvtk4lqiix14q468s","title":"Figma agent 正式开放至 FigJam 和 Figma Slides","originalTitle":"The Figma agent is now available in FigJam and Slides","summary":"Figma ag